# Interpreter-throw closure item 6, the dynamically selected callable: the selected callee's convert passes through
# the caller of the formal, which has no handler, to the root: R0 stops with the implicit ordinal convert = 3
# (before: the site's invariant abort).
fn: conv (int: x) int
    int: neg 0 - x
    size_t: s (neg)
    return: x

fn: apply (op(fn: (int: x) int) int(value)) int
    return: op(value)

int: r apply(conv 1)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
